# Line endings stay LF on every checkout, Windows included. Git for Windows
# turns LF into CRLF by default, and a shell script with CRLF fails inside
# the Linux containers ("exec /app/deploy/entrypoint.sh: no such file or
# directory"), so the web container never starts and the browser shows
# 502 Bad Gateway. The other text files stay LF so that a rebuilt image
# holds the same bytes on any machine.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
